🔒 Data Availability

Due to ethical restrictions, institutional review board policies, and patient privacy regulations, complete whole-slide images (WSIs), raw clinicopathological data, and patient-identifiable 
material cannot be publicly shared.
Only representative examples and directory structures are provided to facilitate reproducibility of the computational pipeline.
